    "answer": {
      "short": "$DCXY$ is a parallelogram.",
      "worked": "In parallelogram ABCD, $DC=AB$ and $DC\\parallel AB$. In parallelogram ABXY, $YX=AB$ and $YX\\parallel AB$. Therefore $DC=YX$ and $DC\\parallel YX$. Quadrilateral DCXY has one pair of opposite sides both equal and parallel, so it is a parallelogram.",
